#: ../../source/features.rst:20
msgid ""
"The tables below list what *anphon* can calculate and which force constants "
"must be available. FC2, FC3, and FC4 are the harmonic, cubic, and quartic "
"force constants. In *alm*, they correspond to ``NORDER = 1``, ``2``, and "
"``3``, respectively. ✓: required; (✓): required only for the option given in "
"the note."
msgstr ""
"以下の表は、*anphon* で計算できる物性と、それに必要な力定数をまとめたものです。FC2、FC3、FC4 はそれぞれ調和、3 次、4 "
"次の力定数で、*alm* の ``NORDER = 1``、``2``、``3`` に対応します。✓: 必要、(✓): "
"注に記したオプションを使う場合のみ必要。"

